{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Definitions_and_Properties\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Definitions and Properties</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solving_the_Equation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solving the Equation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/1/7511df60c8dca7bc4d4ced1d3ad994b7b884acaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x-5 \\log 3=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"153\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b9847c547b54b439994ba951d0b6d31b65d9c54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1.25\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0.81\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2.43\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 0.8\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{either 0.8 or 1.25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"547\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Definitions_and_Properties\">Definitions and Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Definitions and Properties\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/8/8d8ef5d99b6283c2870a6ee57f083ca8c96c374c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"37\" height=\"16\" /> is defined as the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfies the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/1/9f135da376cb60cbd4fb8c32f861f6380f745139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 10^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />. Note that other bases can be applied as well, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/8/fc809ff3e90681a47fa3e54f78ddb7fd855c67c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> would be defined as the answer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/a/67ab2f96822c38c8e7958f4f624a5729a3d68096.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = b^x$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/78263d8cdd68a8efcd82ef34f9001f9a4eb40685.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\log n = \\log n^y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"119\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cbceb3958176eebe0ff53a217a9c8a8d5910abe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x - \\log y = \\log (x / y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Learn more properties here: [<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.rapidtables.com/math/algebra/logarithm/Logarithm_Rules.html\">[1]</a>]\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solving_the_Equation\">Solving the Equation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solving the Equation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/1/7511df60c8dca7bc4d4ced1d3ad994b7b884acaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x-5 \\log 3=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"153\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f270feadf22aeae4013983226ceb2803ab98aeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x- \\log 3^5=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14fbc61614a8d8ca11c1decf16e97a5dc516a39d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x- \\log 243 =-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"159\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/3/9835cf60c698dd9dc4ae4cbdc7cb00c840ba18d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x / 243 = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea983b2f2b4091272325cf9118f0591b888b10e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x/243 = 10^{-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e843c1bbb8477ea9c01aad2be4c703cb2faa59ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{243}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/a/0ca97ce2db6472b2e09e4430330202f8a3320c29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }2.43}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"113\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1955\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /